"%(reason)s is a reason to take a transfer off a trip before it leaves, not "
"to send it back from the route."
msgstr ""
"%(reason)s es un motivo para quitar una transferencia de un viaje antes de "
"que salga, no para regresarla desde la ruta."

#. module: stock_fleet
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/stock_fleet/wizards/wizard_stock_picking_unbatch_correction.py:0
msgid ""
"%(reason)s says the goods travelled and came back: register the transfer as "
"not delivered instead."
msgstr ""
"%(reason)s indica que la mercancía viajó y regresó: registra la "
"transferencia como no entregada."

#. module: stock_fleet
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/stock_fleet/models/stock_picking_batch_trip.py:0
msgid ""
"%(vehicle)s is still out on trip %(trip)s: register its return before it "
"leaves again."
msgstr ""
"%(vehicle)s sigue en el viaje %(trip)s: registra su regreso antes de que "
"vuelva a salir."

