msgstr "Este viaje ya registró su odómetro de regreso."

#. module: stock_fleet
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:stock_fleet.field_stock_picking__delivery_proof_ok
msgid ""
"Ticked by itself when the photo is uploaded. A reviewer unticks it when the "
"photo does not show this delivery slip signed, and whoever uploaded it is "
"asked for another one."
msgstr ""
"Se marca solo al cargar la foto. Un revisor lo desmarca cuando la foto no "
"muestra esta remisión firmada, y se le pide otra a quien la cargó."

#. module: stock_fleet
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/stock_fleet/models/stock_picking_trip.py:0
