msgstr ""
"No se puede registrar el viaje %(batch)s a las %(moment)s: la hora está en "
"el futuro o es anterior a la salida del viaje."

#. module: stock_fleet
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/stock_fleet/models/stock_picking_batch_trip.py:0
msgid ""
"Trip %(batch)s cannot close while %(pickings)s have no outcome: deliver "
